        "created_at": "2016-12-20T04:45:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The setup card still remains out which is why that works. &nbsp; In the case of Kaargra only one side of her setup card says the heroes can't win. &nbsp; The oversized cards do muddle this up a bit but the setup text remains in affect. &nbsp;</p>",
